abstract: >-
  A worked analytical application of Reliance Lens to the NIST AI Risk
  Management Framework. The artifact examines shared dependencies, control
  coupling, practical authority, human oversight, and recovery under degraded
  operating conditions, with candidate measurement constructs for future
  empirical validation.
keywords:
  - AI risk management
  - NIST AI RMF
  - AI assurance
  - TEVV
  - human oversight
  - control coupling
  - operational resilience
  - structural dependence
